  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Environmental Justice and Climate Change Mitigation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to raise awareness on environment and climate issues in Egypt and providing legal support to the most vulnerable affected communities. The project will deliver five different, but complementary, interventions: providing legal assistance, developing and launching a website on a healthy environment and climate change, producing and publishing two videos on impacts of pollution and climate change in Egypt and publishing reports on the different impacts of climate change in Egypt; its and environmental violations in Egypt and carrying out 3 workshops for 30 lawyers where the index of all laws/regulations governing environmental and climate justice issues is presented among other training materials.</narrative>
  </description>
